                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-7" aria-label="Return from footnote 7.">Return to 7</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-8">Reis (2021) analyzes the degree and timing of the unanchoring of inflation expectations during the 1960s and 1970s in the U.S. and discusses the use of dispersion as a sign of unanchoring.
